  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2017-11-01T09:52:09.332Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "95% of time when I see kick voting I decline it since I don't even know the reason why someone proposes to kick someone else. I suppose most of the people do the same, that's why current kick voting system doesn't really help in moderation. So my proposal is to remove it completely and kick players based on how many people blocked them in current world. Blocking is the most natural reaction to people who spam and harass others so if several people block someone then he or she should have done something wrong and should be temporarily kicked from current world. With this kind of system one doesn't need to vote directly since already voting by blocking",
